# Home Assistant (and you, for testing) see everything
user ha
topic readwrite #

# Every device logs in with its own id as the user name (e.g. esp32-den) and may only
# write under its own topics: home/<id>/... and its Home Assistant discovery config
pattern readwrite home/%u/#
pattern write homeassistant/+/%u/#
# Home Assistant says "online" here when it restarts, so devices send their config again
pattern read homeassistant/status
